desc:
Navy sidebar (Clinical · Practice · Assistant · Admin groups) with module rail colours, facility name, signed-in user and role; tablet 72px icon rail; mobile bottom tabs (Today · Patients · Inbox · Messages · More). Items are filtered by the user's capabilities and by tenant feature flags (MDV-P0-028) so later-phase screens stay hidden. Notification bell placeholder (D-03 ships in P1).
ac:
- A receptionist sees only Practice items (front desk, schedule, register) and never Clinical items.
- A doctor sees Clinical + Practice items allowed by the matrix; items behind disabled flags are not rendered.
- Layout switches at 768 px (rail) and 360–767 px (bottom tabs) per the responsive rules.
- Keyboard: skip-to-content link, visible focus, logical tab order; sidebar is a nav landmark.
- The day-one R0 capability "see role-based navigation" can be demonstrated for each role in the seeded tenant.

